    <h1>Alien Orrery</h1>
    <p>A chart of an imagined solar system, as the civilisation living in it might draw it. This is the same civilisation you've been passing on the rest of this site.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Kimina-Santuri/alien-orrery" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get the Mac app <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
